                  <TextRun>
                    <Value> If Borrower defaults on its payments and fails to cure said default within a reasonable amount of  time, Lender will have the option to declare the entire remaining amount of Principal and any accrued Interest immediately due and payable and thereafter set-off the balance against all monies kept in the savings account.</Value>
