                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value> In the event any provision of this Agreement is deemed invalid or unenforceable, in whole or in part, that part shall be severed from the remainder of the Agreement and all other provisions should continue in full force and effect as valid and enforceable. </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
