              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>14. Governing Law and Jurisdiction.</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value> The Parties agree that this Agreement shall be governed by the State and/or Country in which both Parties reside/do business. In the event that the Parties reside/do business in different States and/or Countries, this Agreement shall be governed by Eswatini law.</Value>
                    <Style>
